## 4 Road-map / experiments

* **FP4 / Hybrid-INT4** – new compressor (`vllm quantize`) cuts VRAM a further 20 %. Accuracy drop < 3 pp. ([docs.vllm.ai][4])
* **CPU-offload vision tower** – `--vision-device cpu` keeps SigLIP on host RAM if GPU0 is tight.
* **Heterogeneous TP** – mix 3060 + 3090; vLLM 0.9 handles uneven memory. ([github.com][5])

