## 5 Checklist before going live

1. `pip list | grep -E 'vllm|torch|torchao|transformers'` shows

   * vLLM ≥ 0.9, Torch 2.5, TorchAO 0.11, Transformers ≥ 4.53.dev.
2. `nvidia-smi` reports ≤ 11.8 GB used per 3060 after warm-up.
3. Test text-only and image-and-text routes.
4. Enable prefix-caching (`default true`) for maximum qps. ([github.com][8])

Once these boxes are green, the INT4 Gemma-3 multimodal model is production-ready on your dual-3060 workstation.

